:: Sister Desk Signature [micro_event event nobr] {"position":"1050,3150"}
/* Desk visitor (micro event 23, "Her excuses to be near me" in Define Events): she wants her internship hours
   signed again, although her college only needs it once a month. Shown in the CMD drawer, so no action is spent
   and there is no exit link. Counts toward $sister.flags.officeExcuses. */
<<set $sister.flags.officeExcuses += 1>>
<p>$sister.callName lays the sheet across my keyboard, right on top of the keys, so I can't pretend to keep typing. It's her internship hours log, the one her college wants signed by a supervisor. She's brought it over often enough by now that I could probably forge my own signature on it from memory.</p>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
	{ who: $sister, text: "Signature, please, right there on the line." },
	{ who: $player, text: "I signed that yesterday." },
	{ who: $sister, text: "You signed yesterday's line. Today gets its own line, that's how days work." },
	{ text: "She already has a pen out for me, uncapped. There's a small plastic flamingo glued to the end of it, and the flamingo is looking at me too." },
	{ who: $player, text: "How often does your college actually want this?" },
	{ who: $sister, text: "End of the month." },
	{ text: "It's out before she can stop it. She hears it about a second after I do, and suddenly the flamingo is very interesting to her." },
	{ who: $sister, text: "But it's good practice, keeping proper records. You like organized people, you have an entire folder just for receipts." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<br>
<div id="desk-signature-choice">
	<div>
		<<link "Sign it">>
			<<replace "#desk-signature-choice">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ text: "I sign. She doesn't take the sheet back right away. She looks at my signature for a moment, as if there's more written there than my name." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "You used to do a little loop at the end, you know." },
					{ who: $player, text: "I was twelve." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "It was a good loop. Standards around here have really slipped." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<p>She stays perched on the corner of my desk for another ten minutes, telling me about a guy in her stats class who drinks a different energy drink every lecture and lines the empty cans up in front of him like trophies. I mostly listen. Every so often she swings her foot and it bumps against my chair. After the third bump she stops swinging it and just leaves her sneaker resting against the leg of my chair.</p>
				<p>When she finally hops down and goes back to her desk, she leaves the hours sheet on my keyboard. Twenty minutes later she has to come back for it.</p>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Ask why she's really here">>
			<<replace "#desk-signature-choice">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "The end of the month is weeks away. What's going on?" },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Nothing's going on. Can't I come over and say hi? Is saying hi against company policy now?" },
					{ who: $player, text: "No." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Then hi." },
					{ text: "She drops into the chair across from me as if that settles it, and starts picking at the flamingo on her pen." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "It's nicer over here, okay? It's calmer. At my desk I read the same email four times and I still don't know what it says, and over here I just..." },
					{ text: "She stops and frowns at the pen as if it had said something stupid, and doesn't finish." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Anyway, just sign the thing." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<p>I sign the thing. She takes it and goes, and halfway across the room she glances back over her shoulder. When she catches me watching, she pretends she was checking the clock on the wall behind me.</p>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 1>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterLust" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Offer to sign the whole month at once">>
			<<replace "#desk-signature-choice">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "Leave it with me. I'll sign the whole month in one go, at the end." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "You can't do that, that's probably fraud." },
					{ who: $player, text: "It's called being efficient." },
					{ text: "She opens her mouth to argue, and I can practically watch her do the math behind her eyes. No sheet, no reason to walk over here tomorrow." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "No, I'm keeping it, and you're signing it every day like a normal supervisor." },
					{ who: $player, text: "Why?" },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Because I'm thorough, that's why. Stop looking at me like that." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<p>She snatches the sheet off my keyboard and marches back to her desk with it, still unsigned. I'd bet money that the flamingo pen is back tomorrow at about the same time.</p>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterLust" 2>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
</div>
